            "1 Jisu ta ai how mak sihni,",
            "Kata ai laalou rap khou ?|7",
            "Ata Kamei kachuc bam e;",
            "Kakhwan thay e, Pou ta thuanc o!",
            "",
            "Ai thay Kakhwan ..",
            "aKaipouc khwan,",
            "Mi ?|7 alung .. tiineihlaalou,",
            "Kamei ata .. kachuc pwkhou,",
            "Pou ta thuanc e!",
            "Kakhwan thay e!",
            "",
            "2 Kalwnliak ai how mak sihni,",
            "Ai Kakhwan chu tanh tan bam e;",
            "Dui kamuatcmei tii’thaekclou e,",
            "’Niw khou chuzaenghmei tiilou e.",
            "",
            "3 ’Chumhmei, ’zihmei lam saalou e,",
            "Howmei paengc thangc",
            "neihlaamei lam;",
            "Zianmei, chuzaenghmei lam saa e,",
            "Tingkauh kai lam akhou saa e."
